# Build context for the Dockerfile: only what `pnpm install`, `prisma` (migrate and seed) and `next build` need.
# Keep prisma/seed-data/**: the seed reads the post bodies and case study write-ups from its .md files.
.git
.github
node_modules
.next
src/generated
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Secrets and local state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Tests, tooling output and docs the image doesn't use
e2e
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
scripts
docs
